Accommodation is not included in our diving plans. You can book your stay directly at our dive base hotels, Hotel San Pedro de Majagua or Hotel Cocoliso, for a more convenient experience. Alternatively, you can stay at other hotels in the area, as long as they have maritime access or a nearby dock. 

